<p>You fold the space between yourself and a second point within a range of 10, creating a pair of wormholes.  Any creature stepping on either wormhole will be teleported near the other (radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">5, 3, 3, 2, 2</acronym> accuracy).  </p><p>The wormholes will last <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns and must be placed at least two tiles apart.</p><p>The chance of teleporting enemies will scale with your Spellpower.</p>